        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>The Peninsula Surf Club continued to support local young surfers and their families through our two Peninsula surf teams. Over 50 participants ranging from 5th to 8th grade joined our after school developmental and competitive teams. Contests were held through the Scholastic Surf Series events.With the support of Ocean Beach Surf and Skate, PSC raised $5,000 for programs at Ocean Beach Elementary School during our annual "Skate For The Kids" fundraising event.Peninsula Surf Club also provided assistance and support to the Point Loma High School surf team by offering coaching, equipment, and supplies as well as contest entry fees for team riders at the Ocean Beach Pier Classic surf contest in April 2023 as well as Baja Surf Club's San Miguel contest in December 2023."</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
